; The xact command keeps a total `@@` cost: the drafted posting prints
; with `@@` and the total, and the balancing posting is inferred in the
; cost's commodity ($-60.00).

2024/01/01 Grocery Store
    Expenses:Food    10 AAPL @@ $50.00
    Assets:Cash   $-50.00

test xact 2024/06/15 Grocery to Expenses:Food '@@' '$60.00' '10 AAPL' from Assets:Cash
2024/06/15 Grocery Store
    Expenses:Food                            10 AAPL @@ $60.00
    Assets:Cash
end test
